@startuml Worker执行和任务完成（第三部分）

!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 50

participant "DispatchQueue" as Queue
participant "TaskClient" as Client
participant "Worker" as WorkerNode
participant "DB" as DB
participant "EventBus" as EventBus
participant "FireWorker" as Worker2
participant "TaskSuccessHandler" as Handler
participant "TaskSuccessAction" as Action

== 任务调度到Worker ==

Queue -> Queue: takeTaskExecuteRunnable()

Queue -> Client: dispatch(taskRunnable)
Client -> Client: 负载均衡选择 Worker
Client -> DB: updateById(状态: DISPATCH, host)
Client -> WorkerNode: RPC调用 dispatchTask()
WorkerNode -> WorkerNode: 执行任务

== Worker回调 ==

WorkerNode -> EventBus: RPC回调\nonTaskExecutorSuccess()
note right of WorkerNode: TaskExecutorEventListenerImpl\n发布 TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent
EventBus -> EventBus: delayEventQueue.add(event)

== 任务成功处理 ==

Worker2 -> EventBus: poll()
EventBus --> Worker2: TaskSuccessLifecycleEvent

Worker2 -> Handler: handle(workflowRunnable, event)
Handler -> Handler: 选择 TaskSuccessStateAction
Handler -> Action: succeedEventAction(...)

Action -> DB: updateById(状态: SUCCESS, endTime, varPool)
Action -> Action: mergeTaskVarPoolToWorkflow()
Action -> EventBus: publish(WorkflowTopologyLogicalTransitionEvent)

Action --> Handler: 处理完成
Handler --> Worker2: 处理完成

@enduml
